        "text": "MySQL (Port 3306)\nThe MySQL database server uses TCP port 3306, and the same concepts apply\nto it when it comes to enumeration as previously discussed:\nI\nI Brute-forcing credentials\nI\nI Identifying if the installed version is exploitable\nI\nI Basic enumeration scan of MySQL\n$nmap -sV -O -sC -p 3306 [IP Address]\nI\nI Advanced enumeration scan of MySQL\n$nmap -sV -O -p 1521 --script=mysql* [IP Address]\nI\nI Brute-force of MySQL\n$ hydra  -L [users file] -P [passwords file] MySQL://[IP]",
